{
  "__file": "wp_block",
  "title": "SoleMart — Nike buying-guide example",
  "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"solemart-best-guide\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group solemart-best-guide\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-guide-intro\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-guide-intro\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The best Nike shoes for men start with one question: what will you use them for? A daily running shoe, a lifting trainer and a casual sneaker solve different problems—even when they share the same Swoosh.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This shortlist brings together seven options for running, gym sessions and everyday style. Start with your main activity, then use the fit checks and trade-offs below to narrow the choice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The quick answer:</strong> Start with the <a href=\"#nike-pegasus\">Pegasus for running</a>, the <a href=\"#nike-metcon\">Metcon for lifting</a>, or the <a href=\"#nike-air-force-1\">Air Force 1 for casual outfits</a>. There is no single winner for every activity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-disclosure\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-disclosure\">Some links below lead to Amazon. We may earn a commission from qualifying purchases, at no extra cost to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-quick-picks\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-quick-picks\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-eyebrow\">YOUR SHORTLIST</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"quick-picks\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"quick-picks\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Seven picks. Find your starting point.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Start with what you do most. Select a model to jump to its strengths, trade-offs and buying link.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"hasFixedLayout\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Best for</th><th>Our pick</th><th>Start here if…</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>For daily running</td><td><a href=\"#nike-pegasus\">Nike Pegasus 42</a></td><td>Daily running and occasional walking.</td></tr><tr><td>For gym &amp; lifting</td><td><a href=\"#nike-metcon\">Nike Metcon 10</a></td><td>Strength sessions and functional training.</td></tr><tr><td>For everyday style</td><td><a href=\"#nike-air-force-1\">Nike Air Force 1 Low</a></td><td>Jeans, chinos, shorts and casual outfits.</td></tr><tr><td>For lifestyle cushioning</td><td><a href=\"#nike-air-max-90\">Nike Air Max 90</a></td><td>Casual wear with a visible-Air aesthetic.</td></tr><tr><td>For retro style</td><td><a href=\"#nike-cortez\">Nike Cortez</a></td><td>Low-profile casual and retro outfits.</td></tr><tr><td>For basketball-inspired style</td><td><a href=\"#nike-air-jordan-1\">Nike Air Jordan 1 Mid</a></td><td>Streetwear and a more prominent casual silhouette.</td></tr><tr><td>For mixed gym sessions</td><td><a href=\"#nike-free-metcon\">Nike Free Metcon 7</a></td><td>Varied gym sessions and functional workouts.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-method\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-method\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-eyebrow\">BEHIND THE PICKS</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"how-we-chose\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"how-we-chose\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">How we chose</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our selection starts with intended use: running, strength training or casual wear. We then compare the fit checks and trade-offs that matter for each job. These are research-based starting points, not reports of SoleMart wear testing or lab measurements. Confirm the current model’s specifications, available widths and retailer terms before choosing. Read <a href=\"/how-we-review\">how we review shoes</a> for our editorial approach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-label\"><strong>01</strong> For daily running</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"nike-pegasus\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"nike-pegasus\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nike Pegasus 42</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-layout\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-layout\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-visual\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-visual\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"sm-product-image\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full sm-product-image\"><img src=\"https://thesolemart.com/placeholder.svg\" alt=\"Placeholder for Nike Pegasus 42 product photograph\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Nike Pegasus 42</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-lede\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-lede\">Start here when your week revolves around road runs, treadmill sessions and a shoe you can also wear on the way home.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> Daily running and occasional walking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why it makes the shortlist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Pegasus has a clear role in this shortlist: a daily trainer rather than a specialist race shoe or a lifting platform. Check the exact release’s cushioning and fit details, and try it with your running socks before committing. Consider whether most of your runs are on roads, treadmills or another surface before narrowing your options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros-cons\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A focused starting point for a daily-running shortlist.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Fits a routine that includes roads and treadmills.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A useful alternative to running in a lifestyle sneaker.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-cons\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consider</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A cushioned running platform is not the starting point for heavy lifting.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Confirm the named version and available widths on the exact listing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Nike+Pegasus+42+men\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Buy on Amazon</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-cta-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-cta-note\">Search Amazon listings for this model. Check the exact version, size, seller and return terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-label\"><strong>02</strong> For gym &amp; lifting</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"nike-metcon\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"nike-metcon\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nike Metcon 10</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-layout\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-layout\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-visual\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-visual\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"sm-product-image\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full sm-product-image\"><img src=\"https://thesolemart.com/placeholder.svg\" alt=\"Placeholder for Nike Metcon 10 product photograph\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Nike Metcon 10</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-lede\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-lede\">Put your lifting sessions first. This is a gym-focused starting point for a strength-led routine.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> Strength sessions and functional training.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why it makes the shortlist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you spend more time on lifting platforms than on the road, look at the Metcon before a running shoe. Compare the actual model’s base, heel feel and grip with your training routine. For workouts that include longer runs, a separate running pair may serve you better.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros-cons\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A training-focused option for a strength-led routine.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A clearer match for gym use than a casual fashion sneaker.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lets you prioritize platform feel and secure fit.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-cons\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consider</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Not the pick here for regular distance running.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A firm training feel may not suit your everyday walking preference.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Nike+Metcon+10+men\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Buy on Amazon</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-cta-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-cta-note\">Search Amazon listings for this model. Check the exact version, size, seller and return terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-label\"><strong>03</strong> For everyday style</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"nike-air-force-1\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"nike-air-force-1\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nike Air Force 1 Low</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-layout\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-layout\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-visual\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-visual\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"sm-product-image\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full sm-product-image\"><img src=\"https://thesolemart.com/placeholder.svg\" alt=\"Placeholder for Nike Air Force 1 Low product photograph\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Nike Air Force 1 Low</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-lede\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-lede\">The casual starting point: a recognizable low-top to work into outfits you already wear.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> Jeans, chinos, shorts and casual outfits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why it makes the shortlist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choose the Air Force 1 when styling is your main task. The low-top shape works as an outfit-building reference, but material and fit can differ between editions. Compare the exact colorway’s upper and care requirements; the name alone is not a promise of all-day walking comfort.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros-cons\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A familiar low-top silhouette for casual wardrobes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Easy to compare across neutral and statement colorways.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A distinct style choice alongside the performance-led picks.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-cons\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consider</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use a dedicated running shoe for regular running.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Check weight, ventilation and comfort for your own walking routine.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Nike+Air+Force+1+Low+men\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Buy on Amazon</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-cta-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-cta-note\">Search Amazon listings for this model. Check the exact version, size, seller and return terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-label\"><strong>04</strong> For lifestyle cushioning</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"nike-air-max-90\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"nike-air-max-90\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nike Air Max 90</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-layout\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-layout\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-visual\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-visual\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"sm-product-image\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full sm-product-image\"><img src=\"https://thesolemart.com/placeholder.svg\" alt=\"Placeholder for Nike Air Max 90 product photograph\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Nike Air Max 90</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-lede\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-lede\">A lifestyle option for readers who want a more substantial silhouette and the recognizable Air Max look.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> Casual wear with a visible-Air aesthetic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why it makes the shortlist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Air Max 90 fills the everyday-style side of this guide rather than the training side. Compare it with the Air Force 1 if you prefer its shape and visible cushioning design. Comfort is still personal: check toe room, heel security and the feel of the complete shoe during a try-on.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros-cons\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>An alternative to slim retro silhouettes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A recognizable design for streetwear and casual outfits.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A useful lifestyle comparison alongside the Air Force 1.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-cons\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consider</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A lifestyle design does not replace a dedicated training shoe.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The more substantial silhouette may not suit every outfit or foot.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Nike+Air+Max+90+men\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Buy on Amazon</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-cta-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-cta-note\">Search Amazon listings for this model. Check the exact version, size, seller and return terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-label\"><strong>05</strong> For retro style</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"nike-cortez\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"nike-cortez\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nike Cortez</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-layout\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-layout\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-visual\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-visual\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"sm-product-image\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full sm-product-image\"><img src=\"https://thesolemart.com/placeholder.svg\" alt=\"Placeholder for Nike Cortez product photograph\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Nike Cortez</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-lede\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-lede\">Go this way if a slim, vintage-inspired profile suits you better than a chunky modern sneaker.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> Low-profile casual and retro outfits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why it makes the shortlist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Cortez brings a different shape to this shortlist. Try it with the trousers or shorts you wear most and compare the toe shape with your foot. Treat this as a casual-style choice; a retro running heritage is not the same as suitability for your current running program.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros-cons\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A slim visual alternative to the Air Max silhouette.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A clear retro styling direction.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Worth comparing for a simpler casual rotation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-cons\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consider</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Check cushioning against your needs for long days on foot.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Fit and upper materials vary, so review the exact edition.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Nike+Cortez+men\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Buy on Amazon</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-cta-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-cta-note\">Search Amazon listings for this model. Check the exact version, size, seller and return terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-label\"><strong>06</strong> For basketball-inspired style</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"nike-air-jordan-1\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"nike-air-jordan-1\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nike Air Jordan 1 Mid</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-layout\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-layout\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-visual\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-visual\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"sm-product-image\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full sm-product-image\"><img src=\"https://thesolemart.com/placeholder.svg\" alt=\"Placeholder for Nike Air Jordan 1 Mid product photograph\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Nike Air Jordan 1 Mid</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-lede\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-lede\">The statement pick for a casual wardrobe that favors a higher collar and basketball-inspired design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> Streetwear and a more prominent casual silhouette.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why it makes the shortlist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Jordan 1 Mid occupies a style role here. Compare its collar and paneling with the low-top options, and check whether the shape feels comfortable around your ankle. If your goal is competitive basketball, research a current performance court shoe for the surface and movements you play on.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros-cons\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A different silhouette from the low-top casual picks.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A defined basketball-inspired style direction.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Colorways let you choose a subtle or more expressive look.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-cons\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consider</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Do not assume a higher collar guarantees ankle protection.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>This shortlist does not establish suitability for competitive basketball.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Nike+Air+Jordan+1+Mid+men\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Buy on Amazon</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-cta-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-cta-note\">Search Amazon listings for this model. Check the exact version, size, seller and return terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-label\"><strong>07</strong> For mixed gym sessions</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"nike-free-metcon\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"nike-free-metcon\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nike Free Metcon 7</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-layout\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-layout\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-visual\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-visual\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"sm-product-image\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full sm-product-image\"><img src=\"https://thesolemart.com/placeholder.svg\" alt=\"Placeholder for Nike Free Metcon 7 product photograph\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Nike Free Metcon 7</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-lede\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-lede\">Consider this alongside the Metcon if your workouts mix strength exercises with more dynamic movement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> Varied gym sessions and functional workouts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why it makes the shortlist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Compare the Free Metcon with the regular Metcon for the balance of movement and platform feel you prefer. Check the exact model against the exercises you actually perform. A mixed workout can still include tasks that call for different shoes, particularly longer runs or specialized lifting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros-cons\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A second training option for a mixed-workout shortlist.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Encourages a direct comparison with the regular Metcon.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A focused gym alternative to a lifestyle sneaker.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-cons\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consider</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Check stability against your own lifting routine.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Do not treat mixed-training versatility as distance-running suitability.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Nike+Free+Metcon+7+men\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Buy on Amazon</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-cta-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-cta-note\">Search Amazon listings for this model. Check the exact version, size, seller and return terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-buying-advice\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-buying-advice\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-eyebrow\">BEFORE YOU BUY</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"buying-advice\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"buying-advice\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Choose the shoe for your day</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Choose the job before the look</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Decide whether you mainly run, lift or dress casually. Start in that category, then compare cushioning, shape and materials. If two activities have very different demands, two appropriate pairs can be more useful than asking one shoe to do everything.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Let the fit rule a pair out</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Try both shoes with your usual socks. Check toe room, heel security and pressure across the top of your foot. Do not rely on a universal rule to size up or down: follow the current model’s guidance and compare actual width options. Our <a href=\"/blog/how-to-choose-walking-shoes\">shoe-fitting checklist</a> gives you a practical starting point.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Compare the exact listing</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nike names can cover different generations, materials and colorways. Before ordering, confirm the version, size, seller, delivery details and return conditions. Compare the features you will use instead of assuming that a higher price means a better choice. Read <a href=\"/blog/are-expensive-shoes-worth-it\">how to judge a shoe’s value</a> for more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-faq\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-faq\"><!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"faqs\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"faqs\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your questions, answered</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Which Nike shoe should I buy first?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choose from your main activity. This draft starts with the Pegasus for daily running, the Metcon for strength-led training and the Air Force 1 for casual style. Compare the exact model and fit before making the final choice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Are Nike shoes suitable for wide feet?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It depends on the model and the width offered in your market. Look for a documented wide option where available and try the actual pair. Do not assume that every model shares the same fit or that a longer size will solve a width problem.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Can I run regularly in Air Force 1s?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A dedicated running shoe is the better starting point for a regular running routine. In this shortlist, the Air Force 1 is a casual-style pick. Compare running-specific options for the distance, surface and fit you need.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Can one pair cover the gym and everyday wear?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sometimes, if the pair meets the demands of your training and feels comfortable for your daily routine. Compare the Metcon and Free Metcon options for gym use, then assess their fit and feel yourself. Longer runs may justify a separate running shoe.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-verdict\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-verdict\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-eyebrow\">THE TAKEAWAY</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"final-verdict\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"final-verdict\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">The right pair starts with your routine</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Buy for the activity you do most. Begin with the Pegasus for running, compare the Metcon options for gym sessions, and shortlist the Air Force 1 or Air Max 90 when everyday style is the priority.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Prefer a slimmer retro look? Try the Cortez. Want a more prominent basketball-inspired silhouette? Compare the Jordan 1 Mid. Once a model fits your purpose, let comfort, the exact listing and the seller’s return terms decide the purchase.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#quick-picks\">Back to the shortlist ↑</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
  "syncStatus": "unsynced"
}
